@startuml
title Expense Submission, Notification, and Approval Activity (proposed)
|Submitter|
start
:Enter amount, date, description, payer, participants, split;
:Optionally attach receipt;
|Application service|
:Authorize group membership;
:Validate payer, participants, positive amount and split;
if (Valid?) then (yes)
 :Calculate deterministic exact shares;
 :Begin submission transaction;
 :Persist expense as PENDING_REVIEW and exact shares;
 :Persist applicable review-policy version snapshot;
 :Persist notification/outbox intent for eligible group members;
 :Commit transaction;
 fork
  |Notification worker|
  :Read committed outbox intent;
  :Deliver asynchronously to eligible group members;
  note right
   Exclude submitter. Retry transient failures;
   deduplicate deliveries. Failure cannot roll back
   the committed expense.
  end note
 fork again
  |Approver|
  :Review pending expense independently;
  if (Decision?) then (reject)
   |Application service|
   :Record rejection atomically;
  else (approve)
   |Application service|
   :Record decision;
   if (All required approvals?) then (yes)
    :Atomically approve and post ledger;
   else (no)
    :Remain pending; no ledger effect;
   endif
  endif
 end fork
else (no)
 :Return clear validation error;
endif
stop
@enduml
